<title>INDONESIA: Great River says Q1 net almost double.</title>
<headline>Great River says Q1 net almost double.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>				    (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  7.3	vs	 4.1</p>
<p>    Net sales			 62.39	vs     51.55</p>
<p>    Operating profit		14.60	vs     10.10</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    31.98	vs     24.17</p>
<p>    Profit before income tax     8.11	vs	4.49</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     62.97	vs     38.90</p>
<p>NOTE : The results were unaudited. Company's full name is PT Great River International.</p>
</text>
